"Modern Comfort Food,"

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:08.074 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
is on sale now.

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:10.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
Please welcome back to the sho
our friend Ina Garten.

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:12.946 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hello, Ina.
How are you?

00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:14.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
