it's not the same place.

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:20.687 align:start size:94% position:6%
Of course, the last time
we saw each other

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:23.556
was maybe the most fun tim
we've ever had together.

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:25.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
We went day drinking
together, Ina.

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:26.693 align:start size:94% position:6%
